
Installing Zeus module to Thor
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

You must have setup Thor 2.2 or higher.

1) Copy the Thor/ directory from this distribution to your THOR directory,
   e.g. (replacing BBS:Thor/ with your THOR directory).

 1> Copy Zeus:Thor/#? BBS:Thor/ ALL

2) Type in a shell (replacing BBS:Thor/ with your THOR directory).

 2> Execute BBS:Thor/s/cfgzeus

3) Load up THOR.

4) In the THOR menu select "Configuration->Systems Config" (Amiga-.)

5) Hit "NEW", and call the system name whatever you like.

6) Select type "ZEUS" from the listbox.

7) Hit "SAVE"

8) From a shell, use Bin/AddZeusArea to add areas from your Zeus
   message configuration to your Thor areas configuration, e.g.

   SYSTEMNAME is whatever you defined your system as in step 5.

   1> Bin/AddZeusArea <SYSTEMNAME> ALL

   ..or,

   2> Bin/AddZeusArea <SYSTEMNAME> RANGE 200-210

   ..or,

   3> Bin/AddZeusArea <SYSTEMNAME> AREA 1000

   You can add more areas later.

9) Back in Thor, Add two ARexx scripts to the ARexx menu (Amiga-M)

   First is:

   rexx/GrabZeus.thor  (I used function key 19, Shift-F9)

   Second is:

   rexx/PackZeus.thor  (I used function key 20, Shift-F10)

10) To import new messages from Zeus hit Shift-F9, to export written
    messages to Zeus hit Shift-F10!

Et voila!

Hope these docs. help :)

Nick.

